SUMMARY:Clay Street Unit
LOCATION:The Moroccan Lounge\, Downtown
DESCRIPTION:The Moroccan Lounge presents: Clay Street Unit with support fro
 
m The Last Wild Buffalo [November 4\, 2026 / Doors 9:30pm / $22 adv / $25 d
 
os / 21+] Hailing from Denver\, Colorado\, Clay Street Unit mixes the acous
 
tic instrumentation of bluegrass and folk with the amplified energy of Amer
 
icana and country. The result is a singular interpretation of American root
 
s music that blurs the borders between genre and geography\, fusing the inf
 
luence of the Rocky Mountains with the traditions of the Appalachians. Driv
 
en forward by drums\, sharp songwriting\, and the chemistry of good friends
 
 and musical brothers who've shared countless hours on stage\, Clay Street 
 
Unit's music doesn't just nod to the band's influences\; it reshapes them i
 
nto something new. With their debut album on the horizon\, Clay Street Unit
 
 are staking their claim as torchbearers of something both fresh and famili
 
ar\, nodding to the foundations of American music while sharpening their ow
 
n progressive edge. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/clay-stree
 
t-unit-los-angeles-california-11-04-2026/event/090064E1B31E8CA1
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/clay-street-unit-los-angeles-california-11
 
-04-2026/event/090064E1B31E8CA1
END:VEVENT
